==In the manga==
===Pokémon Adventures===
===={{MangaArc|Black & White}}====
[[File:Janitor Geoff Adventures.png|thumb|200px|Janitor Geoff in Pokémon Adventures]]
[[File:Ace Trainer Chase Janitor Shawn Adventures.png|thumb|130px|left|A Janitor in Alola]]
Janitor Geoff (Japanese: '''シンノスケ''' ''Shinnosuke'') is a recurring character in [[Pokémon Adventures]], debuting in ''[[PS476|A Direct Attack and a Daunting Defense]]''. {{adv|Black}} and {{adv|White}} first encountered Geoff on the [[Skyarrow Bridge]] after being attacked by a mysterious Pokémon on their way to [[Castelia City]]. Geoff berated the two for getting the bridge dirty and challenged Black to a battle. After losing, Geoff revealed that he is actually the president of the Battle Company, and that the Pokémon that had attacked them was the [[Legendary Pokémon]] {{p|Virizion}}.

In ''[[PS520|Cold Hard Truth]]'', Geoff teamed up with several other Trainers Black had met on his journey to face the [[Seven Sages]] in battle during [[Team Plasma]]'s attack on the {{un|Pokémon League}} and rescue the kidnapped [[Gym Leader]]s. Eventually they succeeded, then proceeding to help defeat the {{tc|Team Plasma Grunt}}s attacking the League.

===={{MangaArc|Sun, Moon, Ultra Sun & Ultra Moon}}====
In ''[[PASM19|Truth and the Mastermind Behind Team Skull]]'', a Janitor was briefly shown being intimidated by the [[Ultra Beast]]s that showed up in [[Alola]].
